    "summary": "With TYRANIDS as your Army Faction, any TYRANIDS unit of yours that has at least one friendly SYNAPSE model within 6″ is in Synapse Range of the SYNAPSE model and also of your army. While it is in your army’s Synapse Range, it rolls 3D6 rather than 2D6 for Battle-shock tests, and every melee attack made by its models gets +1 Strength.",
